WEBVTT

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:19.550
There's no time for rest.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:21.200
Wh-What?!

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:24.830
Next is ten laps of
dashing up and down these stairs!

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:26.460
Huh?!

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:29.500
Please wait until I
catch my breath at least...

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:31.000
Nonsense!

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:34.590
This is an important part
of training to gain the power

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.550
to do your comebacks
when you're at your limit!

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:37.880
Now go!

00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:39.510
Y-Yes!

00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:54.520
Do a comeback...

00:00:54.730 --> 00:00:58.030
...when I'm at my limit!

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:08.910
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:12.080
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:20.720
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:33.980
<i>The feelings after frustration</i>

00:01:34.190 --> 00:01:39.490
<i>Are beyond my every choice</i>

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:45.120
<i>Resolve myself to not accept losing</i>

00:01:45.330 --> 00:01:50.160
<i>Then stand up onto a new stage</i>

00:01:50.370 --> 00:01:55.710
<i>White, glistening sweat is beautiful</i>

00:01:55.920 --> 00:02:01.090
<i>I decided I'll live my life</i>

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:03.970
<i>No matter how many times I fall</i>

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:10.640
<i>If I stand up the same,</i>
<i>it will lead me to tomorrow</i>

00:02:10.850 --> 00:02:13.350
<i>With a strong feeling to not lose</i>

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:16.570
<i>Say goodbye to the previous me</i>

00:02:16.770 --> 00:02:21.650
<i>A different me from yesterday is being born</i>

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:24.490
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:27.580
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:35.080
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:02:37.780 --> 00:02:43.330
Episode 05: The Night before the Match!

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:44.550
Excitement is in the air, here
at the Japan Performance Stadium.

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:46.220
With reigning number one fan favorite...

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:48.850
...Hagiwara Sakura,
challenging the world of wrestling...

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:52.520
...the center vocal
position has been left vacant.

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:56.520
But tonight, one will be
decided to hold this glorious position!

00:02:56.860 --> 00:03:00.440
The fifth Sweet Diva
Center Vocal Fan Election...

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:04.240
center vocal winner goes to...

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:08.910
Miyazawa Elena!

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:14.040
Miyazawa Elena is the
new center vocal for Sweet Diva!

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:17.710
A perfect win, well ahead
of the second runner-up!

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:22.510
Without faltering to Hagiwara
Sakura's challenge into pro wrestling...

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:26.890
Miyazawa Elena led the new Sweet Diva.

00:03:28.510 --> 00:03:31.810
Finally, she obtains the
title of being number one!

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:36.650
The dream of becoming the center vocal...

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:39.480
I couldn't be happier.

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:43.780
But, what's with this unsatisfying feeling?

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:47.820
Would I have been
number one if Sakura was here?

00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:50.950
I still haven't beaten Sakura.

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:54.330
Getting the center vocal position
without going against Sakura...

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:57.040
...doesn't make me the real center vocal.

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.750
Now then, let's have Miyazawa Elena-<i>chan</i>

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:03.960
relay her words of joy to everyone!

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:08.510
Thank you... everyone.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:11.470
From the last election until today...

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:13.100
...many...

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:16.270
...really, many things have happened.

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:19.190
Some of you may not
be satisfied with this result...

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:25.360
...or may think that who you
were cheering for will change.

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:29.450
But! The Sweet Diva
you love will not change!

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:32.870
No... I won't have anything changed!

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:36.040
So please, place your trust in me!

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:39.500
You're the best, Elena-<i>chan</i>!

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:43.210
We'll follow you forever!

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:51.090
Sakura...

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:53.140
Hurry back...

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:59.640
It hurts...!

00:05:01.060 --> 00:05:03.520
Of course it hurts! Endure it!

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:05.860
What's important is to endure,
then follow with a comeback!

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:08.990
Now then, what to do next.

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:10.700
Take this!

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:16.290
Now then...

00:05:16.490 --> 00:05:18.330
It's my turn!

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:26.800
Endure through, and then do a comeback!

00:05:33.550 --> 00:05:36.390
Whoa! Hagiwara's pinned to the ropes!

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:39.770
Hornet's public execution is going to start!

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:43.940
Looking good there, Ms. Idol.

00:05:44.770 --> 00:05:47.030
I won't let you get away!

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:51.740
Get up, Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:53.240
Stand up, Hagiwara!

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:55.700
Hagiwara, get up!

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:01.210
How's... this!

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:04.080
A Camel Clutch using her bamboo sword!

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:07.340
The League of Evil's
relentless attacks continue!

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:13.970
This is a first for Hagiwara
to take on such obvious foul plays!

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:17.640
Hornet, you're breaking the rules!

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:18.520
One!

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:19.270
Two!

00:06:19.470 --> 00:06:20.140
Three!

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:21.770
Four!

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:26.980
Do you think you're off the hook?

00:06:30.940 --> 00:06:32.360
Th-The pain...!

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:34.280
My throat feels like it's going to burst!

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:35.910
But...!

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:40.330
What?!

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:43.500
Endure...

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:46.420
Endure through, and...

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:47.460
One!

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:48.630
Two!

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:49.750
Three!

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:51.380
Four!

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:54.050
...Do a comeback!

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:55.680
What?!

00:06:57.350 --> 00:07:00.600
Take this...!

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:07.440
You're not getting away!

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:14.240
This isn't over yet!

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:16.110
Referee! She's pinned!

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:17.660
One!

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:18.700
Two!

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:20.330
Hell no!

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:22.080
I still can't finish it?!

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:24.710
I can get things this far, but...!

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:34.050
One!

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:35.630
Two!

00:07:35.840 --> 00:07:37.260
Three!

00:07:39.550 --> 00:07:43.600
Hagiwara! She loses her
win again at the last moment!

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:46.940
This now marks her sixty-fifth loss!

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:50.980
I'm a lot stronger now
from Misaki-<i>san</i>'s training.

00:07:51.190 --> 00:07:55.280
I should have the strength
to endure the opponent's moves.

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:02.120
There must be another
reason why I still can't win.

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:04.450
What am I missing...?

00:08:04.660 --> 00:08:06.620
That was so close!

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:08.920
Win it next time!

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:10.790
That was a good match!

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:13.090
Give it your best again next time!

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:19.220
Thank you very much
for your words of support!

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:26.600
I need to win the next for everyone!

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:29.770
Nice fight, Hagiwara-<i>kun.</i>

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:31.110
President Inoba.

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:32.320
Good news.

00:08:32.520 --> 00:08:35.990
The revenge match against
Kazama Rio's been decided!

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:47.500
What's on your mind?

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:49.870
Huh...? N-Nothing...

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:55.050
"I trained so hard, and I'm
stronger now, but why can't I win?"

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:57.470
Sounds about right?

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:04.140
My goal was always to
have a match against Kazama-<i>san.</i>

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:05.270
But...

00:09:05.470 --> 00:09:09.100
without even having a single win...

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:11.860
do I really have the right to face her?

00:09:12.060 --> 00:09:13.610
Excuses.

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:16.820
In other words, you're not
confident you can win, right?

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:24.870
There's no such thing as a sure way to win.

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:26.620
But...

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:31.000
...there is a way to grab
a win inches away from you.

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:32.790
What?

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.420
A special move.

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:37.340
Special move?

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:44.350
You mean a move like the Misaki Special?

00:09:44.550 --> 00:09:46.100
Yes.

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:50.060
Because you don't have one,
you can't finish the match...

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:52.230
...even after cornering them.

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:54.480
How do I find...

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:57.360
my special move?

00:09:57.570 --> 00:10:00.150
Figure that out yourself.

00:10:00.860 --> 00:10:04.490
You don't learn special moves from others.

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:08.330
Then... can you <i>give</i>
me your Misaki Special?

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:09.910
Nope.

00:10:10.120 --> 00:10:12.080
Awww...

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:15.540
Special attack! Earthstar The Rainbow!

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:19.050
Special move.

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:23.970
Special move.

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:28.930
Special move...

00:10:32.100 --> 00:10:33.440
Morning, Sakura!

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:34.810
Special... move!

00:10:35.020 --> 00:10:39.440
Ow! Ow! Ow! Stop it, Sakura!

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:43.280
Special move...

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:45.490
What was that about?!

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:47.910
Looks like she's in a rut.

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:49.580
How about giving her a tip?

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:53.750
A special move is a pro
wrestler's wings to lift them.

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:57.880
There's no way she could
fly high with forced wings.

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:10.350
With my size, throws won't
work against larger wrestlers.

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:16.100
With my weight,
pummels wouldn't be very effective.

00:11:16.310 --> 00:11:19.610
I need to find my own
special move outside of existing moves.

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:22.820
A move that no one has seen before...

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:46.260
Elena?

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:47.930
Sakura...

00:11:57.520 --> 00:12:00.150
It's... been awhile, Elena.

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:03.240
Yeah. A long while.

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:07.450
Sorry to get you at a time like this.

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:10.370
I wasn't trying to bother you...

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:12.410
That's fine.

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:15.620
I saw the fan election.

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:18.000
Elena, you became the center vocal, right?

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:18.880
Yeah.

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:22.380
Congrats! I'm really happy to hear that.

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:26.970
Thanks, but this was
while you're away, Sakura.

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:29.470
Honestly, it doesn't feel all that right.

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:31.100
Elena...

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:47.740
W-Without you, things
aren't how it's supposed to be.

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:50.410
For me, and everyone!

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:56.540
Elena, my match
against Kazama-<i>san</i> is set.

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:58.540
What?!

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:01.290
So, it's set...

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:04.590
Finally!

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:08.590
Once that's done, you can come back, right?

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:10.640
Back to Sweet Diva!

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:12.260
Um, yeah...

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:13.770
I see...

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:15.930
But, I'm a bit nervous.

00:13:16.140 --> 00:13:18.230
Can I be able to hold a decent match?

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:20.650
Can I beat Kazama-<i>san</i>?

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:21.900
Sakura...

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:25.570
I know I shouldn't be worried right now.

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:30.570
If I have time for worrying,
I should be training instead.

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:32.780
But, I...

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:50.260
It's times like these
when you need to dance!

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:53.310
Freely, like before!

00:13:54.260 --> 00:13:56.140
Three, two, one, go!

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:32.340
This...!

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:36.470
I haven't felt this good for a long while!

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:41.190
We always sing and dance
with everything we've got.

00:14:41.390 --> 00:14:43.440
That's what we do, right?

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:45.070
Right!

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:47.730
Thanks, Elena.

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:51.200
You need to be smiling, Sakura.

00:14:51.400 --> 00:14:52.990
Huh?

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:55.370
I'm sorry... This is all my fault...

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:56.990
Elena?

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:01.410
If it wasn't for what
happened between Kazama and me...

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:05.840
...you wouldn't have
had to do pro wrestling.

00:15:06.040 --> 00:15:06.840
Elena...

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:08.590
You wouldn't have had to get hurt...

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:12.800
and go through
all the harsh lessons alone.

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:14.640
It's not your fault, Elena.

00:15:14.840 --> 00:15:16.010
I...

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:20.730
I decided on my own
to challenge pro wrestling.

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:26.860
I'm the one to apologize,
having you carry Sweet Diva alone.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:28.980
Sakura...

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:35.910
I guess we were both thinking the same.

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:36.740
Elena?

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:39.450
I'll do my very best this match...

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:41.410
...and wrestle so that I have no regrets.

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:44.500
Okay, I'll be there to cheer for you.

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:00.680
Are you sure you want it this high?

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:03.480
Yes! Thank you very much!

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:08.270
The match of fate has come again, but...

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:10.610
...do you have any thoughts on this?

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:12.110
Fate?

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:13.820
You've got to be kidding.

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:18.660
It's a bother having a
loser cling to me this long.

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:20.040
I see.

00:16:20.240 --> 00:16:24.710
But there's a rumor that
Hagiwara has a plan in the works.

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:26.420
Bring it on!

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:30.250
She can keep doing whatever
useless training she's doing.

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:32.760
Freaking idol!

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:53.780
Kazama Rio

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:53.780
Hagiwara Sakura

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:28.850
Good night!

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:33.610
You were great out there, Yuho!

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:36.360
Huh? Really?!

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:39.200
Elena.

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:41.910
Nanami... Great job!

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:43.200
Thanks!

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:45.410
You're looking great today.

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:46.790
You think so?

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:49.460
It looks like you got something off of you.

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:54.170
I can't hide things
from you, can I, Nanami?

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:56.090
Was it that obvious?

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:59.050
Even more obvious when
you had your makeup off earlier.

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:00.510
Huh...?!

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:02.550
I'm just kidding.

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:06.220
So, tomorrow is finally Sakura's match.

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:07.730
Yeah.

00:18:07.930 --> 00:18:10.520
You're going to go and cheer her on, right?

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:11.860
Huh?

00:18:12.060 --> 00:18:14.110
I know...

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:19.820
...you didn't go to her matches,
even when you were worried.

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:22.120
I just...

00:18:22.320 --> 00:18:25.160
...didn't want to get in Sakura's way.

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:28.660
But tomorrow's match...

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:30.080
I know.

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:33.330
Thanks for worrying about me, Nanami.

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:38.670
Sakura is going to be fighting
for Sweet Diva's pride tomorrow.

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:40.300
As the center vocal...

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:41.970
No...

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:45.180
I need to cheer her on as a friend!

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:46.810
Elena...!

00:18:47.220 --> 00:18:49.140
Sakura is going to win!

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:52.850
She'll win and come back to Sweet Diva.

00:18:53.060 --> 00:18:54.480
That's right!

00:18:57.190 --> 00:18:59.320
There's no way Sakura-<i>chan</i> will lose!

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:02.570
We're going to go and cheer for her too!

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:03.660
Right.

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:08.620
Let's be there tomorrow to
congratulate and welcome her back.

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:17.710
One for all.

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:20.220
And all our thoughts for our fans!

00:19:20.420 --> 00:19:22.590
Our sweet hearts melted into one!

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:24.760
Sweet Diva!

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:27.010
Yeah!

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:33.770
Nine months have
passed since the last fight.

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:40.820
Performance Stadium

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:40.820
Kazama Rio

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:40.820
Hagiwara Sakura

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:37.150
Hagiwara Sakura is in her
sixty-fifth losing streak, but...

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:43.030
...tonight she will finally face her
fate in a match against Kazama Rio!

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:47.950
As you can see, the Performance
Stadium is filled with excitement.

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:49.910
Wow...

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:53.290
Aren't there more people
here than our performance?

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:56.290
That's our Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:57.920
Sakura...

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:04.970
First, entering the
stage is Hagiwara Sakura!

00:20:22.940 --> 00:20:25.490
Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:30.290
Do your best, Sakura!

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:41.460
Here we go!

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:45.090
Super-cute, super-cute, Sa-ku-ra!

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:49.390
Fighting Princess, Sa-ku-ra!

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:55.390
Making an appearance next is Kazama!

00:20:57.560 --> 00:21:00.440
Now, it's hunting time!

00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:28.760
Transcending fate into a battle of destiny...

00:21:28.970 --> 00:21:33.180
...the gong to start will now ring!

00:21:38.060 --> 00:21:40.520
<i>Three, Two, One, and here we go!</i>
<i>Let's shoot for the greatest stage</i>

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:43.270
<i>Dancing & singing, let's liven things up!</i>

00:21:43.480 --> 00:21:48.030
<i>Together it's a brand new day,</i>
<i>c'mon everyone's cheers are</i>

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:50.910
<i>Fan! Fanfare!!!</i>

00:21:55.410 --> 00:22:00.580
<i>Dreams are our heart's sun</i>

00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:06.210
<i>Let's make them real with our magic</i>

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:11.680
<i>Fashion, makeup, but inside's a passion</i>

00:22:11.890 --> 00:22:15.720
<i>to a bright future</i>

00:22:15.930 --> 00:22:16.850
<i>Step up!!</i>

00:22:17.060 --> 00:22:19.520
<i>The spotlight shines</i>

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:22.190
<i>Microphone stand, fluttering skirts</i>

00:22:22.400 --> 00:22:29.570
<i>The heart's rhythm, swing</i>
<i>swing, notes dance, it's show time!!</i>

00:22:29.780 --> 00:22:35.700
<i>Watch me be No. 1 someday, your No. 1</i>

00:22:35.910 --> 00:22:36.910
<i>Let's sing (All day long)</i>

00:22:37.120 --> 00:22:38.540
<i>Let's dance (All night long)</i>

00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:46.630
<i>With all my love,</i>
<i>more than being first, your smile</i>

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:48.260
<i>is what I want to see (Hold me tight)</i>

00:22:48.460 --> 00:22:52.220
<i>Let's make true my dream</i>

00:22:52.430 --> 00:22:53.470
<i>Anytime, do my best</i>

00:22:53.680 --> 00:22:55.010
<i>Do your best and don't give up</i>

00:22:55.220 --> 00:22:57.520
<i>Dancing & singing, as yourself</i>

00:22:57.720 --> 00:22:58.980
<i>If you like it, it's all fine</i>

00:22:59.180 --> 00:23:02.560
<i>The beat in your heart is your answer</i>

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:05.400
<i>Fan! Fanfare!!!</i>

00:23:07.690 --> 00:23:32.300
Episode 06: Revenge Match!

00:23:08.460 --> 00:23:10.380
Now then! It's finally underway!

00:23:10.590 --> 00:23:12.380
Sakura-<i>chan</i>'s revenge match!

00:23:12.590 --> 00:23:14.590
Facing her is Kazama Rio!

00:23:14.800 --> 00:23:17.720
Honestly, chances are slim for
Sakura-<i>chan</i> to win with her losing streak.

00:23:17.930 --> 00:23:20.430
But, I'm looking
forward to an upset match here!

00:23:20.640 --> 00:23:24.060
So, Chief, keep
that front page open there!

00:23:24.270 --> 00:23:25.640
Wait, what?! You've got to be kidding?!

00:23:25.850 --> 00:23:28.230
Are you sure you're okay
announcing that, Sakura-<i>chan</i>?!

00:23:28.440 --> 00:23:31.980
Yikes... The front page may
not be enough to handle this...!

00:23:32.300 --> 00:23:37.140
A request from Sakura:

00:23:32.300 --> 00:23:37.140
There are a lot of pro wrestling moves in "Sekatsuyo,"
but they're dangerous, so please don't try them at home!
